    "title": "Tasker by Taskrabbit",
    "description": "WHY EARN MONEY ON Taskrabbit?\r\n\r\no CONTACTLESS\r\nTo ensure everyone's safety, Taskrabbit now includes the option for tasks in any category to be contactless.\r\n\r\no YOU CHOOSE\r\nAs your own boss, you decide when and where you want to task, the skills you use, and how much you charge on our online marketplace. Schedule around life\u2019s moments and earn flexibly when you want.\r\n\r\no BUSINESS WITHOUT THE BUSYWORK\r\nWe\u2019ll provide the marketing and support you need to grow your business\u2014so you can focus on what you do best. \r\n\r\no HOW TASKING WORKS\r\nSimply set your schedule and Clients will send you invitations to complete their task based on your unique qualifications and availability. \r\n\r\no MAKE MONEY\r\nInvoice and get paid directly through our secure payment system. Clients are encouraged to tip following each completed task\u2014and you keep the whole amount.\r\n\r\no FIND US IN THESE CITIES\r\nAlbany/Capital Region, Albuquerque, Ann Arbor/Detroit, Atlanta, Austin, Baltimore, Baton Rouge, Boise, Boston, Charlotte, Charleston, Chicago, Cincinnati, Cleveland, Columbus, Corpus Christi, Dallas/Fort Worth, Denver, Des Moines, El Paso, Fresno, Honolulu, Houston, Indianapolis, Jacksonville, Kansas City, Las Vegas, Los Angeles & Orange County, Louisville, Memphis, Miami, Milwaukee, Minneapolis/St. Paul, Nashville, New Haven, New Orleans, New York City, Norfolk-Portsmouth-Newport News, Oklahoma City, Omaha, Orlando, Philadelphia, Phoenix, Pittsburgh, Portland, Raleigh/Durham, Reno/Carson City, Richmond,  Sacramento, Salt Lake City, San Antonio, San Diego, San Francisco Bay Area, Seattle, St. Louis, Tampa/St. Petersburg, Tucson, Tulsa, Washington D.C., Wichita, Columbus/Auburn",
